        "created_at": "2013-10-15T04:16:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This forum's search function is WORTHLESS.&nbsp; (To be clear, I'm not just saying that to be a jerk; what I mean is that when I search for Brain Burn, I find every topic that has a post from Reckless in it because his signature has the word \"brain\" in it.&nbsp; It's NOT an intelligent search engine.)&nbsp; So from now on I pretty much have to create a new topic for every question I ask, since you don't want me doing them all in the one topic I created for the purpose.</p><p>Today's question:&nbsp; When you play Visionary's Brain Burn, do you put the cards from the villain trash on the bottom in any order you choose, or only the order that they happen to be in?&nbsp; It could make a huge difference whether you were able to essentially stack the villain deck.</p>",
